transport_leg)). No mention of origin_leg_loaded or destination_leg_loaded. Wait there are separate assemble actions for fully loaded, destination loaded, origin loaded, nominal. The generic assemble_transport_leg does not set origin_leg_loaded or destination_leg_loaded. So after generic assemble, origin_leg_loaded and destination_leg_loaded remain false (unless previously set). Good. So we can use generic assemble to have origin_leg_loaded false, destination_leg_loaded false. Then we need to load container onto leg (which loads container but does not set origin_leg_loaded or destination_leg_loaded). After loading container, we need to stage candidate (requires not origin_leg_loaded). That's fine.)
