(Now we need to ensure that we don't accidentally undo any needed conditions via actions that have negative effects (like deallocating vehicle, etc.). Many actions have negative effects that remove availability of resources. We must be careful not to break goals.)
(Let's list actions and their effects:)
(- create_candidate: adds candidate_created, no negatives.)
(- allocate_vehicle_unit: adds vehicle_allocated, candidate_vehicle_linked, removes vehicle_available.)
(- attach_task_profile: adds candidate_task_profile_linked, removes route_task_profile_available.)
(- confirm_candidate_preparedness: adds candidate_prepared (no negatives).)
(- assign_operator_resource: adds candidate_operator_linked, removes operator_available.)
(- assign_skill_certificate: adds candidate_skill_certificate_linked, removes skill_certificate_available.)
